sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as ask route + agent
  participant BR as Bedrock Converse
  participant GD as sql-guard
  participant RS as Redshift / Athena
  P->>BR: Converse system=catalog+rules, tool=run_sql
  loop until stopReason not tool_use, max 8 iters
    BR-->>P: tool_use run_sql with sql
    P->>GD: sanitizeSelect sql, maxRows 200
    alt not read-only or multi-stmt or forbidden
      GD-->>P: rejected with error
      P-->>BR: toolResult error, model self-corrects
    else valid
      GD-->>P: wrapped SELECT with LIMIT 200
      P->>RS: execute read-only SQL
      RS-->>P: columns and rows
      P-->>BR: toolResult columns, rows up to 50
    end
  end
  BR-->>P: end_turn, final answer in Chinese
  Note over P,RS: every number from a real query, all math in SQL
